comments[21]:
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T06:07:42.721Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Duplicate check 2026-09-28: searched the complete 2826-item snapshot for mutation receipt/output and Plan mutation titles, plus live all-status keyword AND searches for plan mutation output receipt and plan compact. pm-nilh and pm-ch59 are completed general compact-mutation deliveries; pm-5t33or is the broader output-budget programme. No individual owner was found for the Plan mutator full-collection response. Reproduction: pm plan update-step on one step of pm-a8zm returned all 15 steps. Read full live pm-nilh and pm-ch59 metadata and the complete event history before filing this distinct adapter/receipt gap."
    edited_at: "2026-09-28T07:20:06.515Z"
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:13:44.332Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Implementation scope: SDK-owned compact Plan mutation receipts and explicit inspection recovery; paired with pm-zqxlfs linked-evidence note correction in one mutation-contract PR. Regression fixtures will exercise unrelated Plan payload growth and exact durable linked-resource writes."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:22:20.235Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "TDD evidence: 1000-step fixture initially failed compact-receipt shape and echoed full Plan details. After SDK receipt projection, focused Plan suites and real CLI/native-action acceptance passed. Typed PmClient Plan methods explicitly retain full results; compact consumers receive counts and safe read-only inspection guidance. Full coverage and hosted review remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:25:26.911Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Independent temporary-directory manual acceptance passed under Node and Bun: init, compact Plan create, complete-step, deep inspection, and verified hash-chained history. Completion output was 891 bytes. Required-mode Sentry/telemetry gate passed: no unresolved critical/high issues in the 14-day window, telemetry finish error rate 1.48 percent, zero failed rows missing error codes. GitHub security inventories each returned zero; pnpm audit reported no known vulnerabilities. Release 2026.9.28 recovery run 36380136948 is successful after original Windows npm-global failure, already tracked by pm-q7c36n. Chrome CodeFactor inspection unavailable because CUA_REPL_ENABLED_SURFACES is unset; GH-1311/1312 remain linked to pm-z3ez."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:34:28.720Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Validation update: packed package smoke passed for npx and bunx. Real temporary tracker exercised Node/Bun evidence-note replacement and retry idempotency, compact Plan completion (891 bytes), explicit deep read and verified history. Production telemetry flush drained its queue, and collector query confirmed fresh command_start/command_finish events including telemetry at 08:33 UTC; this establishes recent delivery, not universal per-action completeness. Coverage remains running; its current failures include directory file cap and invocation wall-clock margin. No acceptance claim yet."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:39:44.212Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Full coverage attempt completed 751 files: 9377 passed, 11 failed, two platform skips; no complete coverage artifact was emitted. Seven assertions assumed the previous full Plan envelope or eight-task transcript; directory cap required relocating the new test into lifecycle/. Updated existing full-result fixture normalization to opt into full Plan output, while the new CLI receipt acceptance explicitly preserves production defaults. MCP narrow-tool tests now assert compact identity and recover persisted evidence through deep show. Three timing/timeout failures will be rerun unchanged without competing assurance scans."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:40:44.512Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Focused post-fix verification: all 222 tests across 11 affected integration and contract suites passed. Unchanged invocation-profile and source-scanning timeout cases pass without the competing tracker scan. Full static and canonical full-source coverage remain pending; no threshold, timeout, coverage inclusion, or ignore-directive relaxation was made."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:54:59.913Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Static chain passed docstring content/coverage, exports, ESLint, duplicate checks, repository structure, workflow/dependency policy, generated surfaces, package and command contracts, refusal closure, all nine task-token journeys, MCP deprecation inventory, all 47 tracker-quality assertions, gate registry and SDK surface. Transcript formatting required only its generated fingerprint refresh; task ceilings stayed unchanged. SDK import timing then failed sdk/merge 240 ms versus 226 ms, recorded under existing pm-bj7rq0; isolated rerun and remaining gates are pending."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T08:58:33.040Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Relationship evidence: co-delivered linked-evidence correction, startup-validation investigation, release-acceptance diagnosis, and GitHub intake ownership are contextual references, not prerequisites or implementation ownership. Added related edges for those four references while retaining the existing implements and discovered_from lineage; no ordering dependency is asserted."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T09:03:04.715Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Graph composition now passes all 9 assertions after contextual prose references received honest related edges; existing semantic lineage remains intact. Record integrity passes. Mutation gate passed 323 killed/330 total with the same 7 reviewed equivalent waivers and zero new failures. Performance remains a local qualification limitation reproduced on untouched base; Node 24 passed all SDK entrypoint imports but several CLI timing ceilings still failed. Full coverage is restarting on CI-aligned Node 24 with four workers and unchanged inclusion/thresholds.
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T09:18:22.311Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Correction to intermediate test progress: final Node 24.12.0 summary reported 9386 passing tests and two failures, both native SQLite ExperimentalWarning pollution of strict stderr assertions in workflow-policy MCP and lossless mutation contracts. That run produced no coverage receipt and is not accepted as green. Restarted the unchanged canonical full-source coverage gate on supported Node 26.9.0 with four workers; no warning suppression, assertion relaxation, timeout increase, or coverage exclusion was introduced."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T09:35:45.446Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Canonical full-source coverage passed on Node 26.9.0 with four workers: 750 test files passed, one platform-only file skipped; 9388 tests passed and two Windows-only tests skipped. Exact coverage gate passed 100/100/100/100: statements 65763/65763, branches 50338/50338, functions 13607/13607, lines 62809/62809. No inclusion, ignore, assertion, timeout, or threshold changes were used. Version consistency and docs/skills gate passed."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T09:39:41.727Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Reviewed-delivery preparation: linked tests passed 100 tests; full typecheck passed. Latest pm-changelog 2026.9.25 generated both fixes under Unreleased. Post-closure defect-evidence gate reports zero findings; tracker-context-quality, graph-composition and record-integrity verdicts pass. Final secret scan found no credential-like secrets. Both completed claims are released; no items remain in progress."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T09:58:45.190Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "PR 1335 round one: hosted coverage/static/typecheck passed, while package-first smoke assumed the old Plan envelope. Validated review findings require compact no-changed-fields projection, tracker-qualified recovery and a named public receipt type. Source fixes retain explicit full output. Added meaningful docstrings to touched reorder/remove owners; policy-task acceptance criteria now preserve required checks and release behavior. Sourcery reported its free review quota exhausted; Greptile and CodeRabbit completed substantive reviews."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T10:09:57.573Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Round-one corrections pass 60 focused persistence/projection tests and 41 token-gate tests, including real replay and independent wrong-root/changed-command negative controls. Package-first dogfood now consumes compact receipts and verifies decisions/discoveries/validation/resume through deep reads. Tracker-qualified recovery adds 86 estimated tokens to this PR new planning journey (762 to 848); all eight previously published task ceilings remain unchanged. Replay predicts only declared Plan recovery root substitutions across isolated workspaces and still measures raw emitted bytes."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T10:25:29.580Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Revised full coverage attempt was not accepted: 9385 passed, five failed, two platform skips, and no coverage receipt. Three dogfood script unit fixtures still emitted the old full Plan envelope despite the real 89-command journey passing; updated only their documented external-process responses. Two unchanged source-scan tests exceeded their existing 30-second limits. Focused rerun and exact coverage remain required; no timeout or threshold relaxation."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T10:26:31.222Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Final focused recovery passed all 60 tests across dogfood acceptance-script contracts and the two unchanged source-scan cases (both below four seconds). Real package-first journey passed 89 commands. Review corrections and linked checks are locally verified; exact revised-source 100/100/100/100 must be established by the mandatory hosted coverage gate before merge. The unsuccessful local full attempt remains explicitly recorded and is not a coverage receipt.
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T11:09:48.003Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Round-three review: confirmed HTTP and stdio share the MCP dispatcher. Two real JSON-RPC regression cases fail before the fix because compact and full receipts expose the resolved tracker path. SDK dispatch now recognizes the existing transport provenance symbol and rebuilds only MCP receipts without host roots; native SDK and CLI retain tracker-qualified recovery. Recovery reuses the original MCP workspace selection. Added meaningful documentation for every named touched function identified by an AST/diff scan."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T11:12:51.447Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Round-three verification passed: 69 focused real-transport/persistence/token tests, 103 linked tests, typecheck, targeted ESLint, canonical docstrings, docs/skills and SDK surface checks. Two negative-control MCP cases failed before the fix and pass afterward, including recovery with the original workspace selection. Previous head bcb57c0 hosted CI 36410228965 achieved exact 100/100/100/100; the new correction must independently pass required hosted coverage and renewed bot review before merge. No thresholds, coverage exclusions, or timeout limits changed."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T11:27:53.333Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Exact head 4939779 hosted coverage passed; static failed only because the reclosed-item order was not yet included in generated CHANGELOG.md. DeepScan reported NULL_POINTER at the new test response cast (finding 235567158). GitHub provided only the count; Chrome CUA is unavailable, so the public read-only DeepScan API supplied the exact diagnostic. Add explicit structured-result and receipt guards, then regenerate and await the complete changelog output before committing. Greptile reviewed 4939779 at 5/5 with no outstanding findings; CodeRabbit free-review cooldown remains pending."
  - created_at: "2026-09-28T12:02:06.884Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final full CodeRabbit review on a0a56d4 found no new code/security defect, but requested positive release wording and reported 79.17 percent touched-function documentation. Updated the canonical title through PM; the original defect description and immutable history are preserved. AST inspection identified the five remaining undocumented inline callbacks across receipt previews, identity matching, replay recovery and fixture title generation; added purpose-specific JSDoc without behavior changes. Build, ESLint, canonical docstrings and docs/skills pass. The source behavior already passed exact hosted coverage in CI 36415947716."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
